Signed-off-by: Valentin Raevsky <valentin@compulab.co.il>
---
 arch/arm/dts/ucm-imx91-u-boot.dtsi        |  211 +++
 arch/arm/dts/ucm-imx91.dts                |  546 ++++++++
 arch/arm/mach-imx/imx9/Kconfig            |    5 +
 board/compulab/ucm-imx91/Kconfig          |   83 ++
 board/compulab/ucm-imx91/Makefile         |   12 +
 board/compulab/ucm-imx91/lpddr4x_timing.c | 1488 +++++++++++++++++++++
 board/compulab/ucm-imx91/spl.c            |  178 +++
 board/compulab/ucm-imx91/ucm-imx91.c      |  168 +++
 configs/ucm-imx91_defconfig               |  187 +++
 include/configs/ucm-imx91.h               |  168 +++
 10 files changed, 3046 insertions(+)
